WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:05.380
So two weeks ago, I did a story asking, is
the United States a failed state?

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.290
We failed on a medical response to the pandemic.

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:12.019
Health systems falling apart, corruption,
no trust in government.

00:00:12.019 --> 00:00:13.519
Are we a failed state?

00:00:13.519 --> 00:00:17.590
We are now finding ourselves asking, is the
U.S. a first world country in light of the

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:21.810
completely absent leadership as federal from
federal government?

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:28.130
As protests rage nationally over out-of-control
policing as it is seen by millions and millions

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:34.079
of people, and in addition to the protests,
literal dumpster fires around the White House

00:00:34.079 --> 00:00:40.460
as the White House sits in darkness with Trump
tweeting as you have violence, police attacking

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:44.879
protesters, protesters attacking police, we're
seeing media get shot with rubber bullets

00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:49.449
and attacked not just physically but ideologically
for their presence at the unrest.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:54.970
Caitlin Rust, a reporter for an NBC affiliate
station in Louisville, Kentucky, was fired

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:01.670
upon by police Friday night covering alive
street protests that was going on CNN report.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:05.659
Reporter Omar Hammen is was arrested while
covering protests over the weekend.

00:01:05.659 --> 00:01:06.659
Subsequently released.

00:01:06.659 --> 00:01:10.620
It was chalked up to confusion by police about
who he was.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.140
He happens to be black.

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:19.100
Last night, Cleveland police said no media
would be allowed in any of the downtown area

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:20.450
as protests raged.

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:23.600
It's not even clear that that's legal to do.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:28.340
This concept of a first world country comes
from the Cold War.

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.250
It has some implicit biases.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:35.890
But really now what we're talking about is
the Westernize developed nations of the world.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.390
So look at what we have.

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:39.970
Corrupt, incompetent leadership.

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:43.760
Increasing attacks on media by government
and by police.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.770
Growing unrest between police and the public.

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:51.520
A judiciary system that has two tiers, one
for the rich and one for the poor.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:56.719
We've got rampant cronyism and corruption,
lack of access to quality health care for

00:01:56.719 --> 00:02:00.710
a huge portion of the country, a failing education
system.

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:05.619
Our response to the corona virus pandemic
has completely failed compared to other developed

00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:06.619
nations.

00:02:06.619 --> 00:02:12.069
Infrastructure is not crumbling, but we are
way behind where we should be for a country

00:02:12.069 --> 00:02:13.069
of our wealth.

00:02:13.069 --> 00:02:15.269
Look at our airports to some around the world.

00:02:15.269 --> 00:02:17.920
Look at our highways to those in many parts
of the world.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:24.060
And meanwhile, our president is sitting in
a white and darkened White House, sometimes

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.270
in the bunker below it.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:31.250
On Friday night, as D.C. literally burns,
providing no leadership, no words of de-escalation,

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:35.190
nothing other than self aggrandizement and
threats to protesters.

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:40.209
So I'm not literally saying we are no longer
a first world country, but more and more we're

00:02:40.209 --> 00:02:44.720
reacting to events the way a less advanced
country would.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.270
I want to hear from you about this.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.739
I will have more about it upcoming.

00:02:47.739 --> 00:02:50.930
Let me know your thoughts on Twitter at David
Pakman.

